{"data":{"body":"**P2:** `submit()` may execute the task inline\u2014for example with a saturated `ThreadPoolExecutor` using `CallerRunsPolicy`\u2014and does not return until the task exits. The handle therefore remains unbound throughout execution, so concurrent `cancel(true)` calls cannot interrupt the running task and invocation-owned work may outlive cleanup. Create a `FutureTask`, bind it before calling `executor.execute(...)`, and add an inline-executor cancellation test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc72qMMf","finding_digest":"c0bf4b7f58fc13ee7b03a6be1837c9005850bec9350b0a11a0d2f07ddf3e1be0","finding_id":"arf_v1_yc7uw72y7qj646ydu27bqn6jab","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::submitexecutortask::execution-handle-bound-before-run","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::submitexecutortask::execution-handle-bound-before-run","line":272,"observation_digest":"9ea9e9e8b4715a99f421b01b3041074c53ea093376c199933a34b1bedc74e789","observation_id":"aro_v1_t2u6t2fuofnjt5bbwantaqihjr","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-29T20:57:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_txz2osashkeydyhwzmmgsq6jhl","reviewed_base_sha":"def1f7ad235ea00f6053079b90da784cf061f895","reviewed_head_sha":"94b28030dd842b9b1b6ec3bc2c505876cb07e018","reviewer":"codex","start_line":272,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_j7d55wpl5xlqzwshu43hxbnqq7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-29T20:57:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
